  SCOPE ADDENDUM to `code-to-claim-wave-council-fronts-conservation-and-execution` (which had left mantle-thermal open): the MANTLE-THERMAL NOMOS — promoting `MANTLE_TP_C` from declared constant to a secular-cooling article of law with a declared crude (physics Low) rate law — is ruled IN SCOPE and fronted. Joseph asked this session what stands between the tree and "principled uplift showing emerged land-masses from the sea" on the globe; the time axis of emergence is exactly this nomos plus a memoized epoch chain over the existing freeboard read. Not covered: any claim the rate law is Earth-calibrated beyond order-of-magnitude; plate emergence; router adoption (still open).
  |reason  `#form-isostasy-column` FE(2) names mantle-thermal as the chain's head and FE(8) lists it as open; the column already parameterizes by T_p and cooling-grows-contrast is unit-tested — the cheapest principled path to dynamic emergence runs through work the segments already own the shape of. Code-wise-fronting clause of Joseph's grant applies.
