  ADOPTED (landed this commit): auditor-priming separation -> #ops-audit-integration FE(6) · auditor-verdict limits (correlated error; verdicts are never store citizens) -> #ops-audit-integration FE(4) + WN specimen · read-status citation hygiene -> FORMAT SS5 · explanatory-claims tribunal -> FORMAT SS3 · isomorphic framing glosses -> FORMAT SS6 · lead-carries-counter-evidence -> this ledger's legend · physics-not-knobs -> #norm-physics-not-knobs (Joseph's 2026-07-02 direction, already law in practice, now in canon).
