  MOOTED FOR NOW, revisit condition named: biosphere-first-forced-decision — nothing in the live tree consumes a land-cover input (erosion runs talus-and-creep-on-rock by declared choice, #obs-lakes-are-routed-over-not-carved-away), so the stand-in-vs-permit fork is not yet forced; it forces the day a system first consumes vegetation/land-cover, and that builder should read this entry.
  RECORDED AS DELIBERATE: FORMAT SS3 carrying ASF's triage without its "three rings" — the rings partition ASF's own proof-shaped corpus by inevitability and are not portable instrument (verified against asf/doc/sop/format.sop.md, read 2026-07-29).
