  Bookkeeping row (red-team find: the mechanism landed 2026-07-24 with segments and tests but no ledger entry). The build-time whole-crate source digest (`VIVARIUM_SRC_HASH`, build.rs + source_hash.rs) is folded into every world-law key stem by `NomosDecl::key`; hand-stamped version strings survive as legible era labels only. `src/bin/` is excluded by Cargo's target model; comment normalization was considered and DECLINED (reasons in source_hash.rs — do not re-open without new information); per-nomos attribution is a measured no-go (`#form-complete-content-addressed-key` Known-incomplete (3)). Claim homes: `#form-complete-content-addressed-key` FE(4) · `#detail-epistemics-toolchain` FE(5).
